       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum.\n\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose.\n- **Daily total:** The maximum is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use, and that is for inflammatory conditions. Usual analgesic dosing is lower.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, cardiovascular events, and fluid retention. These risks rise a lot above the ceiling, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nThis may be a typo. Possible intended orders include:\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- 400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours (for analgesia)\n- 1600 mg/day total, for example 400 mg four times daily\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it. If you really intend 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm the indication and the rationale. I'd still suggest checking with pharmacy first."
      }
